@ECHO OFF
ASPISCAN /FDD > AUX
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 ECHO ZIP detection FAILED > AUX
TYPE C:\ZIP.TXT > AUX
COPY C:\BIG.BIN A:\BIG.BIN > NUL
COPY A:\BIG.BIN C:\PLAIN.BIN > NUL
VERIFY ON
COPY A:\BIG.BIN C:\VERIFY.BIN > NUL
VERIFY OFF
IF NOT EXIST C:\PLAIN.BIN ECHO ZIP plain write FAILED > AUX
IF NOT EXIST C:\VERIFY.BIN ECHO ZIP verified write FAILED > AUX
ECHO ASPIFDD ZIP read/write passed > AUX
ECHO OPENASPI 86BOX ZIP DONE > AUX
